.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-server-storage-mount-command - New install command (rotates the mount key)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro server storage-mount command   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
New install command (rotates the mount key)

.PP
Creates a new access key for the mount and a new single-use install command (the old key stops at once). Use after reinstalling the server or when the command expired.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/servers/{id}/storage-mounts/{mid}/command (operationId renewStorageMountCommand, scope cloud_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for command

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--wait\fP[=false]
	wait until the server is no longer busy

.PP
\fB--wait-timeout\fP=15m0s
	maximum time for --wait


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
